  "details": "A lot of users want extra gesture binds without replacing the necessities and gestures can also accidentally be activated for vr users which is sometimes unpleasant or disrupting depending on the avatar. This suggestion essentially would give players a toggle to disable and enable their animation overrides for themselves and everyone else. That way, neither side has to deal with the above issue and the extra gesture slots idea is more achievable.",
